pySrun4k_BeihangLogin_fixed

This project is a modified version of pySrun4k_BeihangLogin:
https://github.com/ywz978020607/pySrun4k_BeihangLogin

The original project is distributed under the GNU General Public License
version 3. This modified version keeps the same license. See LICENSE for
the full license text.

Major changes in this version:
- Added a modern Srun challenge-based login loop.
- Added environment-variable based credentials for Docker and local runs.
- Added macOS launchd and Linux systemd user-service autostart scripts.
- Updated Docker startup to use the modern login script.
